cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "A Statistical Test of Primary Directions in Predicting Violent Death: Research Code and Data"
message: >-
  If you use this code or data, please cite it as below and give appropriate
  credit with a reference (link) to this repository.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/aborealis/primary-directions-study"
authors:
  - family-names: Borealis
    given-names: Alexey
    website: "https://alexeyborealis.com/"
abstract: >-
  Research code and data for the study "A Statistical Test of Primary
  Directions in Predicting Violent Death: A Null Result" (Correlation,
  The Astrological Association Journal of Research in Astrology):
  the simplified model of death-related primary directions, the
  statistical data files of the study, the published samples needed to
  audit the sampling and the model input, and the scripts that reproduce
  the published Monte Carlo, bootstrap, and power analyses.
keywords:
  - primary directions
  - predictive astrology
  - violent death
  - null result
  - reproducibility
  - research data
